---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout 
  title="Tentang Kami — Sonae Beauty Studio Madiun: Filosofi #semuaberhakcakep"
  description="Cerita perjalanan Sonae Beauty Studio Madiun, standar kebersihan hospital-grade, sertifikasi terapis profesional, dan filosofi #semuaberhakcakep."
  activePage="tentang-kami"
>

  <!-- ================================================================= -->
  <!-- HERO TENTANG KAMI -->
  <!-- ================================================================= -->
  <section class="relative w-full max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-8 lg:px-12 pt-8 sm:pt-12 pb-10">
    <div class="flex flex-col lg:flex-row items-center gap-8 lg:gap-12">
      
      <!-- Text Narrative -->
      <div class="w-full lg:w-1/2 flex flex-col items-start">
        <span class="inline-block px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#FAF2EB] text-[#7F513C] font-bold text-xs tracking-wider uppercase mb-3">
          CERITA &amp; DEDIKASI KAMI
        </span>
        <h1 class="font-serif text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-bold text-[#141414] mb-4 leading-tight">
          Menghadirkan Sanctuary Kecantikan Terbaik di Kota Madiun
        </h1>
        <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-[#444444] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-justify">
          Sonae Beauty Studio lahir dari keyakinan sederhana namun mendalam: **#semuaberhakcakep**. Kami percaya bahwa setiap wanita berhak memiliki ruang aman untuk merawat diri, memulihkan energi, dan menemukan versi terbaik dari dirinya tanpa rasa ragu.
        </p>
        <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-[#444444] leading-relaxed mb-6 text-justify">
          Berlokasi di jalan asri Jl. Thamrin, Klegen, Kec. Kartoharjo, Kota Madiun, studio kami menggabungkan kehangatan keramahan lokal Jawa Timur dengan standar teknik perawatan rambut dan kecantikan modern berkelas internasional.
        </p>

        <div class="flex items-center gap-6">
          <div>
            <span class="font-serif text-3xl font-bold text-[#7F513C]">750+</span>
            <span class="text-xs text-[#666666] block">Ulasan Bintang 5</span>
          </div>
          <div class="w-px h-10 bg-[#E8DFD5]"></div>
          <div>
            <span class="font-serif text-3xl font-bold text-[#7F513C]">100%</span>
            <span class="text-xs text-[#666666] block">Produk BPOM Resmi</span>
          </div>
          <div class="w-px h-10 bg-[#E8DFD5]"></div>
          <div>
            <span class="font-serif text-3xl font-bold text-[#7F513C]">5 Th+</span>
            <span class="text-xs text-[#666666] block">Pengalaman Stylist</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Hero Visual (Borderless) -->
      <div class="w-full lg:w-1/2 aspect-[4/3] rounded-3xl overflow-hidden shadow-soft-card">
        <img 
          src="/images/expert_stylists.webp" 
          alt="Tim Terapis Profesional Sonae Beauty Studio Madiun" 
          class="w-full h-full object-cover object-center"
        />
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ================================================================= -->
  <!-- 4 NILAI UTAMA SONAE BEAUTY -->
  <!-- ================================================================= -->
  <section class="w-full max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-8 lg:px-12 py-10">
    <div class="text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-10">
      <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-[#7F513C] block mb-1">KOMITMEN KUALITAS</span>
      <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-[#141414]">4 Pilar Pelayanan Sonae</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6">
      
      <div class="rounded-3xl bg-white p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-soft-card flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div>
          <div class="size-12 rounded-2xl bg-[#FAF2EB] text-[#7F513C] flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[24px]">verified_user</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-serif font-bold text-lg text-[#141414] mb-2">Keamanan Produk BPOM</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-[#555555] leading-relaxed">
            Hanya menggunakan produk bersertifikasi BPOM resmi yang terbukti aman bagi helai rambut, kulit kepala sensitif, dan kuku.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="rounded-3xl bg-white p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-soft-card flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div>
          <div class="size-12 rounded-2xl bg-[#FAF2EB] text-[#7F513C] flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[24px]">sanitizer</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-serif font-bold text-lg text-[#141414] mb-2">Sterilisasi UV-C Alat</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-[#555555] leading-relaxed">
            Seluruh gunting, sisir, dan perkakas manicure disterilisasi dengan sinar UV-C dan alkohol medis sebelum digunakan pada setiap pelanggan.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="rounded-3xl bg-white p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-soft-card flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div>
          <div class="size-12 rounded-2xl bg-[#FAF2EB] text-[#7F513C] flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[24px]">support_agent</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-serif font-bold text-lg text-[#141414] mb-2">Konsultasi Tanpa Paksaan</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-[#555555] leading-relaxed">
            Stylist kami mendengarkan kebutuhan gaya Anda dan menganalisa kondisi rambut secara transparan tanpa *hard-selling*.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="rounded-3xl bg-white p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-soft-card flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div>
          <div class="size-12 rounded-2xl bg-[#FAF2EB] text-[#7F513C] flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[24px]">payments</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-serif font-bold text-lg text-[#141414] mb-2">Harga Transparan</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-[#555555] leading-relaxed">
            Pricelist yang jujur dan jelas. Setiap estimasi biaya diinformasikan di awal sebelum tindakan perawatan dimulai.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ================================================================= -->
  <!-- PERJALANAN & VISI STUDIO -->
  <!-- ================================================================= -->
  <section class="w-full max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-8 lg:px-12 py-12">
    <div class="rounded-3xl bg-[#F4EFEA] p-6 sm:p-10 md:p-14 shadow-soft-card flex flex-col lg:flex-row items-center gap-8 lg:gap-12">
      <div class="w-full lg:w-1/2 aspect-[4/3] rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-sm">
        <img 
          src="/images/affordable_care.webp" 
          alt="Suasana Nyaman & Hangat di Sonae Beauty Studio Madiun" 
          class="w-full h-full object-cover object-center"
        />
      </div>

      <div class="w-full lg:w-1/2 flex flex-col items-start">
        <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-[#7F513C] block mb-2">VISI KAMI</span>
        <h3 class="font-serif text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-[#141414] mb-4">
          Bukan Sekadar Salon, Ini Rumah Kecantikan Anda
        </h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-[#444444] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-justify">
          Di Sonae, kami percaya waktu yang Anda luangkan untuk diri Anda adalah momen berharga. Oleh karena itu, interior studio dirancang dengan pencahayaan hangat, alunan musik yang menenangkan, serta aroma essential oil aromaterapi yang melepas penat rutinitas harian.
        </p>
        <p class="text-sm text-[#444444] leading-relaxed mb-6 text-justify">
          Apakah Anda ingin menyegarkan potongan rambut, mewarnai dengan gradasi balayage impian, mempercantik kuku dengan Japanese nail art, atau merawat lentik bulu mata — Anda selalu berada di tangan yang tepat.
        </p>
        <a href="/booking" class="px-7 py-3.5 rounded-xl bg-[#7F513C] text-white font-bold text-xs hover:bg-[#633B2A] shadow-sm transition-all">
          Kunjungi Studio Kami
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</Layout>

<script>
  import { gsap } from 'gsap';

  function initTentang() {
    gsap.from('h1, h2, h3', {
      opacity: 0,
      y: 20,
      duration: 0.7,
      stagger: 0.12,
      ease: 'power3.out'
    });

    gsap.from('.rounded-3xl', {
      opacity: 0,
      y: 25,
      duration: 0.8,
      stagger: 0.1,
      ease: 'power2.out'
    });
  }

  document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', initTentang);
  document.addEventListener('astro:page-load', initTentang);
</script>
